            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Build 432: Board AI can live in the Quick terminal</h3>
<ul>
<li>Right-click the Board AI tab and choose Move to Quick Terminal or Move to Main Window.</li>
<li>Board AI settings have a new Show Board AI in option, also reachable from Cmd-P.</li>
<li>Board AI returns to the main window when the Quick terminal is turned off or closed, and its place is kept after relaunch.</li>
<li>Card actions chosen in the Quick terminal open in the main window.</li>
<li>The Board is now named Board AI.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
